ADDITIONS (verifier findings, labelled)
- BuildSprites builds buckets[0..Length-2]; if the brightmap overflow bucket is split by FinalizeTextureBuckets, its earlier chunks would be built as 0x0 arrays (GLTextureArrayBuilder.cs:81-85, 263-264, 276-305). Latent.
- With CacheSprites=false, arrays built once (m_spritesCached); sprites first loaded on later maps go standalone (one draw each).

